kubectl apply -f https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/dashboard/v2.7.0/aio/deploy/recommended.yaml

kubectl -n kubernetes-dashboard edit deployment kubernetes-dashboard

Find the container spec, and under args:, add:
        - --enable-skip-login
        - --disable-settings-authorizer

Save and exit. Kubernetes will redeploy the Dashboard pod with those flags.

kubectl proxy

http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/v1/namespaces/kubernetes-dashboard/services/https:kubernetes-dashboard:/proxy/

kubectl apply -f admin-role-binding.yaml